  "description": "<p>Export downloads are currently unauthenticated URLs with a guessable path. Replace them with short-lived signed links scoped to the requesting user.</p><p>Security: this also closes what Checkmarx reported on the old download path — <code>Path_Traversal</code> in the download controller, and <code>CVE-2022-23529</code> through <code>jsonwebtoken@8.5.1</code>, upgraded to 9.0.2.</p>",
  "acceptanceCriteria": [
    "Links expire after 15 minutes",
    "A link issued for one user cannot be used by another",
    "Expired links return 403, never the file"
  ],
  "aiSummary": "<p>Replaces guessable export URLs with <b>15-minute signed links</b> scoped to the requesting user. PR is approved with two approvals and no open comments — this is ready to merge.</p>",
  "aiSummaryAt": "2026-10-08T02:00:00Z",
  "confluence": [
    {
      "title": "Link signing standard",
      "url": "https://confluence.example.com/x/link-signing",
      "excerpt": "HMAC-SHA256 over path + user id + expiry. 15 minutes is the platform default."
    }
  ],
